  "prefLabel": "Cub 301.14 Not in current use (NICU)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 301.14 “Not in current use (NICU)” means land not in current use as identified by the map, which has:\n\n(a) Not met the qualifying criteria for current use assessment; or\n\n(b) Not been included by the landowner(s) as being enrolled in current use assessment.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cub 300) #12857-B, eff 8-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cub100-300.html"
